\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.1}{\ignorespaces Inference pipeline: Optiland forward model, basis-coefficient feature extraction, multivariate Gaussian likelihood, Nautilus nested sampling, and differential-evolution refinement with PSF/OPD validation.\relax }}{18}{figure.caption.11}%
